# Docker & Deployment

## Multi-Architecture Support
- Provide Dockerfile and Compose snippets that work on x86_64 and ARM64 (buildx)
- Keep images small, cacheable, with clear tag/version conventions

## Onboarding
- Onboarding must work with one command: `make setup && make qa`
- Reference [Makefile](mdc:Makefile) for setup instructions

## Protected Paths
- Don't modify files under: infra/terraform/live/*, docs/_export/*, scripts/private/*, secrets/*
- Ask before touching repo-specific protected paths